run_test

使用单例模式，调用uvm_coreservice:get_root 来创建一个 uvm_root 的实例，这个实例携带了domain，domain中包含所有的 phase

调用uvm_root:run_test

```systemverilog
task run_test (string test_name="");
  uvm_root top;
  uvm_coreservice_t cs;

  // Get the singleton instance of the UVM core service
  cs = uvm_coreservice_t::get();

  // Get the root component from the core service
  top = cs.get_root();

  // Call the run_test method on the root component
  // This initiates the UVM test execution
  top.run_test(test_name);
endtask
```

