这个函数用来检查当前环境中 action ，用于查找 severity 对应的行为，具体的查找过程分为三步:

先检查对于当前的 severity level，是否有对于当前 id 的 action 设置
再检查是否对当前 id 设置了 action
如果都没有，则返回默认的 severity_actions

```systemverilog
// Stores actions for specific message IDs
uvm_id_actions_array id_actions;

// Stores default actions for each severity level
uvm_action severity_actions[uvm_severity];

// Stores actions for specific combinations of severity and message ID
uvm_id_actions_array severity_id_actions[uvm_severity];
```
```systemverilog
function uvm_action get_action(uvm_severity severity, string id);

  uvm_id_actions_array array;

  // First, check if there's a specific action for this severity and id combination
  if(severity_id_actions.exists(severity)) begin
    array = severity_id_actions[severity];
    if(array.exists(id))
      return array.get(id);
  end

  // If no specific severity-id action, check for an action associated with just the id
  if(id_actions.exists(id))
    return id_actions.get(id);

  // If no id-specific action, return the default action for this severity
  return severity_actions[severity];

endfunction
```

