Provides methods for comparing various types of data, including integers, real numbers, objects, and strings.
uvm_comparer 类是一个专用于比较数据的类，它的主体是 compare_field，compare_field_int，compare_field_real，compare_object,  compare_string，分别用于比较整数，整数，实数，类，字符串

这里使用了一个 [uvm_object_globals:uvm_recursion_policy_enum]() 类型的变量 policy

  Feature: Data Type | compare_field: uvm_bitstream_t | compare_field_int: uvm_integral_t | compare_field_real: real | compare_object: uvm_object | compare_string: string
  Feature: Max Size | compare_field: 4096 bits | compare_field_int: 64 bits | compare_field_real: N/A | compare_object: N/A | compare_string: N/A
  Feature: Comparison Method | compare_field: Bitwise AND with mask | compare_field_int: Bitwise AND with mask | compare_field_real: Direct comparison (!=) | compare_object: Reference or deep comparison | compare_string: Direct comparison (!=)
  Feature: Radix Support | compare_field: Yes (BIN, OCT, DEC, HEX, etc.) | compare_field_int: Yes (BIN, OCT, DEC, HEX, etc.) | compare_field_real: No | compare_object: No | compare_string: No
  Feature: Null Handling | compare_field: N/A | compare_field_int: N/A | compare_field_real: N/A | compare_object: Yes | compare_string: N/A
  Feature: Recursion Policy | compare_field: N/A | compare_field_int: N/A | compare_field_real: N/A | compare_object: Yes (UVM_REFERENCE, UVM_DEEP) | compare_string: N/A
  Feature: Scope Tracking | compare_field: Yes | compare_field_int: Yes | compare_field_real: Yes | compare_object: Yes | compare_string: Yes
  Feature: Delegate to Other Methods | compare_field: Yes (to compare_field_int for ≤64 bits) | compare_field_int: No | compare_field_real: No | compare_object: Yes (to object's compare method) | compare_string: No
  Feature: Mismatch Reporting | compare_field: Via print_msg | compare_field_int: Via print_msg | compare_field_real: Via print_msg | compare_object: Via print_msg_object | compare_string: Via print_msg
  Feature: Return Value | compare_field: bit (1 for match, 0 for mismatch) | compare_field_int: bit (1 for match, 0 for mismatch) | compare_field_real: bit (1 for match, 0 for mismatch) | compare_object: bit (1 for match, 0 for mismatch) | compare_string: bit (1 for match, 0 for mismatch)

Key differences:

Comparison method:
compare_field and compare_field_int use masking
Others use direct comparison

Radix support:
Only compare_field and compare_field_int support different radix formats for mismatch reporting

Complexity:
compare_object is the most complex

Bit size handling:
compare_field can handle larger bit sizes compared to compare_field_int

Deep comparison:
compare_object is the only method that potentially calls another object's compare method for deep comparison

Simplicity:
compare_field_real and compare_string are the simplest
Perform direct value comparisons

