compare_field_real

Purpose: Compares real numbers.
Operation:
Directly compares lhs and rhs using the != operator.
If different, formats a message with both values.
Uses print_msg to report mismatches.
Key feature: Simple comparison for floating-point numbers.

```systemverilog
virtual function bit compare_field_real (string name, 
                                        real lhs, 
                                        real rhs);
  string msg;

  if(lhs != rhs) begin
    uvm_object::__m_uvm_status_container.scope.set_arg(name);
    $swrite(msg, "lhs = ", lhs, " : rhs = ", rhs);
    print_msg(msg);
    return 0;
  end
  return 1;
endfunction
```

compare_object

uvm_recursion_policy_enum决定了在比较两个类的实例的时候，是仅仅比较句柄还是要具体的比较类中每个字段是否一致。
先采用句柄比较，后面调用uvm_object:compare对值进行一一比较

Purpose: Compares UVM objects, considering the recursion policy.
Operation:
First checks if the objects are identical (same reference).
If policy is UVM_REFERENCE, only compares object references.
Handles null object cases.
For deep comparison, calls the compare method of the lhs object.
Uses scope stack to track hierarchical comparisons.
Key feature: Flexible comparison based on recursion policy.

```systemverilog
virtual function bit compare_object (string name,
                                     uvm_object lhs,
                                     uvm_object rhs);
  if (rhs == lhs)
    return 1;

  if (policy == UVM_REFERENCE && lhs != rhs) begin
    uvm_object::__m_uvm_status_container.scope.set_arg(name);
    print_msg_object(lhs, rhs);
    return 0;
  end

  if (rhs == null || lhs == null) begin
    uvm_object::__m_uvm_status_container.scope.set_arg(name);
    print_msg_object(lhs, rhs);
    return 0;  //miscompare
  end

  uvm_object::__m_uvm_status_container.scope.down(name);
  compare_object = lhs.compare(rhs, this);
  uvm_object::__m_uvm_status_container.scope.up();

endfunction
```

